WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.033
Lie on your back with your operated leg straight.

2
00:00:07.725 --> 00:00:12.397
Rest your head and shoulders. Keep the other leg relaxed on the bed.

3
00:00:14.218 --> 00:00:19.262
Slide your heel towards your bottom, bending your operated knee.

4
00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:25.489
Keep your heel on the bed. Move within your comfortable range.

5
00:00:27.204 --> 00:00:32.646
Slowly slide your heel away until your operated leg is straight again.

6
00:00:33.697 --> 00:00:39.584
Keep your hips still. Do not force the bend or push through sharp pain.

7
00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:46.183
The heel stays in contact as your operated knee bends, then slides back out.

8
00:00:46.683 --> 00:00:52.125
Slowly slide your heel away until your operated leg is straight again.

9
00:00:53.176 --> 00:00:58.220
Use the range and repetitions your physiotherapist has prescribed.
